-Bold,55,&H00FEFEFE,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,1.25,0,2,15,15,383,1Style: Main-207+-furigana,Impress BT Pace,41,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.9,1.9,2,180,180,27,1Style: Narrator-207+-furigana,Impress BT Pace,37.5,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.9,1.9,8,180,180,27,1Style: Narrator-207+,Impress BT Pace,75,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,180,180,27,1Style: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Title-207+,Gilroy-Bold,110,&H00FEFEFE,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,2,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,383,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Captions-207+,Impress BT Pace,70,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.4,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Attack,Dry Brush,92,&H0086ECFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000026,&H96000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.4,1.4,2,12,12,27,1Style: Author,LeviBrush,34,&H00FFFFFF,&H0000FFFF,&H37000000,&HFFB07236,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,4,1.2,1.2,9,6,6,6,1Style: Note-207-,Impress BT Pace,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,3,8,180,180,27,1Style: Credits-207+,Futura Md BT,27.5,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,1.85,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Karaoke Main,Duality,60,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,7,30,30,10,1Style: FlashbacksSecondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,70,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,7,30,30,10,1Style: Lyrics,Duality,70,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,7,30,30,90,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:00:36.47,0:00:46.47,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:00:01.35,0:00:04.53,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Zenginlik, şöhret, güç...Dialogue: 50,0:00:05.60,0:00:10.90,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi elde eden adam, Korsanlar Kralı, Gold Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:00:11.47,0:00:17.37,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Son sözleri dünyanın her yerinden maceracıları denize çekti.Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazinem mi?Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.17,0:00:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstiyorsanız, size vereceğim! Arayıp bulun!Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.59,0:00:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi orada bıraktım!Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.84,0:00:31.34,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık herkes, hayallerinin peşinde Grand Line’a yelken açıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.95,0:00:36.10,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya, Büyük Korsan Çağı'na girdi!Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.06,0:00:41.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası küçük bir liman köyü.Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.19,0:00:46.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir yıl önce bir korsan gemisi köye demir attı.Dialogue: 50,0:00:46.44,0:00:51.17,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğuya doğru esen bir rüzgar,  bu huzurlu köyden geçiyor...Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.78,0:00:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy!  Bu sefer ne yapıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.79,0:01:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabrım tükendi!  Ben artık küçük bir çocuk değilim!Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sefer size kanıtlayacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:01:04.13,0:01:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Göster bakalım! Gerçi ne yapacağını bilmiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.72,0:01:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh!!Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.84,0:01:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerizekalı!  Ne yapıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:14.39,0:01:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şerefe, çocuklar!Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.56,0:01:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'nin cesaretine ve bizim büyük yolculuğumuza!Dialogue: 50,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aah, hiç de acıtmadı ki!Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.44,0:01:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalancı!  Böyle aptalca şeyler yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.73,0:01:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalan söylemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:01:28.94,0:01:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canımın acımasından korkmam.Dialogue: 50,0:01:31.78,0:01:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir dahaki seferine beni de al!Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.16,0:01:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de korsan olmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanki senden korsan olur da!Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.37,0:01:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir korsan için çapa olmak ölümcül bir kusurdur.Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.58,0:01:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiden düşmediğim sürece sorun çıkmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hem dövüşte de iyiyim!Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.71,0:01:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi eğitildiğimden yumruklarım tabanca gibidir.Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.47,0:01:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabanca mı?Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.80,0:01:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hee, öyle mi ?Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.18,0:01:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.47,0:01:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moralin bozuk gibi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaparsan yap eğlenmene bak!Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Korsan olmak eğlenmek demektir!Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz uçsuz bucaksızdır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.11,0:02:11.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çeşit çeşit adaya yolculuk ediyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.57,0:02:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsinden ötesi, özgürüz!Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.66,0:02:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuklar, ona saçma şeyler öğretmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.99,0:02:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama hepsi doğru!Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.33,0:02:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Değil mi?! – Değil mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.04,0:02:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi patron, neden onu sadece bir sefere götürmüyoruz?Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.46,0:02:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bence de.Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse, birisi ona yerini versin.Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekala, konuşma bitmiştir!  İçelim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim tarafımda değil miydiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.97,0:02:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kısaca, daha çok veletsin.Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.93,0:02:38.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,10 sene sonra düşüneceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.93,0:02:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal Shanks!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben velet değilim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.68,0:02:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ama. O kadar kızma!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Al biraz meyve suyu iç!Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay! Teşekkürler!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.56,0:02:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gördün mü? Veletsin işte!Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç adil değil, Shanks!Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.49,0:02:54.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bıktım bunlardan!Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.40,0:02:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, kaptanın nasıl hissettiğini anlamaya çalışmalısın.Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.91,0:02:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkinci kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.83,0:03:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek şu ki, o bir korsan ekibinin başı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.33,0:03:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlığın ne kadar zorlu ve  tehlikeli olduğunu herkesten daha iyi biliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.25,0:03:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.38,0:03:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin şevkini kırmak falan istemiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, anlamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.21,0:03:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks sadece benimle dalga geçiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.59,0:03:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çapa!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.72,0:03:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gördün mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görüyorum ki her zamanki gibi eğleniyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.93,0:03:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, onunla uğraşmayı seviyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.64,0:03:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, sen de bir şeyler yemek ister misin?Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Hazine hesabıma yaz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.86,0:03:31.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine mi hazine hesabı?Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.65,0:03:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dolandırıcılık bu, biliyorsun değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.90,0:03:34.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır değil!Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.65,0:03:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsan olup hazine bulduğumda borcumu ödeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabırsızlıkla bekliyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.79,0:03:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks.Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.83,0:03:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha ne kadar bu köyde kalacaksınız?Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir bakalım...Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.62,0:03:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birkaç sefere daha çıktıktan sonra, bu köyden tamamen ayrılıp kuzeye doğru gideceğiz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birkaç sefer daha demek?Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.05,0:04:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz buradan gitmeden ben de yüzme çalışacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aferin.Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.60,0:04:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkı çalış.Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.65,0:04:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Affedersiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.40,0:04:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek bunlar o korsanlar.Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.99,0:04:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oldukça aptal gözüküyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.16,0:04:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz dağ haydutlarıyız. Ama buraya mekanı dağıtmaya gelmedik.Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz içki istiyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçkim daha yeni bitti.Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu korsanlar bir şey içiyor gibi?Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.97,0:04:42.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ney, su mu?Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.60,0:04:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, son kalanları içiyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten üzgünüm.Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.35,0:04:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım tüm mekanı kuruttuk.Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür dilerim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu alabilirsin.Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha açılmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.41,0:05:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan, sen...Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim kim olduğumu sanıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.91,0:05:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek bir şişe yatmadan önce  dişimin kovuğunu bile doldurmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.92,0:05:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yerler sırılsıklam oldu.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şuna bak.Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.09,0:05:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafama konan ödül, 8 milyon beli.Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.47,0:05:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,56 kişiyi öldürdüm.  Hepsi senin gibi salaklardı.Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendine dikkat etsen iyi olur.Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.56,0:05:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçi, biz dağlarda, siz de denizdesiniz, bir daha karşılaşacağımızı sanmıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dağınıklık için üzgünüm Makino-san.Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.98,0:05:38.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bezin var mı?Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.48,0:05:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, yok! Ben hallederim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Temizlik yapmayı seviyorsun gibi görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.66,0:05:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belki bunu daha tatmin edici bulursun.Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.18,0:06:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi görüşürüz, süt oğlanları.Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.23,0:06:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan-san, iyi misin?Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet. Hiç sorun yok.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ezikliğe gel kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni fena bozdu!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye gülüyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ha? – Oh...Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.49,0:06:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok acınasıydınız!Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden dövüşmediniz?Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.41,0:06:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir şeyin ardından gülüyorsanız  ne erkek ne de korsan değilsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.50,0:06:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl hissettiğini anlayabiliyorum ama  sadece üzerime birazcık içki döktü.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sinirlenmeye değmez.Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, bekle, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.02,0:06:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yetti artık! Senin gibi bir korkak olmak istemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.36,0:07:01.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kolu uzuyor!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.86,0:07:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemiş olamaz...!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.53,0:07:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor ya?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.11,0:07:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmiş!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Neey?! – Neey?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşmanımızdan çaldığımız  Lastik-Lastik meyvesi gitmiş!Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.62,0:07:13.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, bana sakın böyle bir meyve  yediğini söyleme!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.50,0:07:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ye-Yedim.Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.83,0:07:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tadı berbattı.Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.37,0:07:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik Meyvesi,...Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bir şeytan meyvesi olarak bilinen,  denizin gizli bir hazinesidir.Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.80,0:07:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu yemek vücudu lastiğe döndürüp ömrünün  sonuna dek yüzme yeteneğini kaybetmene neden olur.Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.76,0:07:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nee?! Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.09,0:07:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni salak!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.39,0:07:36.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana balık ver, yaşlı balıkçı adam!Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.73,0:07:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine sefere gidemediğini duydum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önemli değil!Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.36,0:07:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çünkü lastik insan oldum. Beni sefere çıkmaktan çok daha mutlu ediyor. Ne yapabildiğime bak!Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.87,0:07:54.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan-san ve tayfası  sefere gideli bayağı bir zaman oluyor.Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim onları özlüyorsundur.Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.29,0:07:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiçte bile!  Daha onları affetmedim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.13,0:08:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks ve diğerlerinin daha havalı korsanlar  olduğunu düşündüğüme inanamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.17,0:08:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.46,0:08:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bence birisi seni öyle aşağıladığında, kafana takmayıp gülüp geçmek daha havalı.Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.97,0:08:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Makino, hiç anlamıyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek adamın kalkıp  dövüşmesi gereken zamanlar vardır.Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım anlamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.10,0:08:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzninizle.Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.77,0:08:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün o lanet korsanlar yok, demek?Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.56,0:08:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar buradan geçiyorduk bir gelelim dedik.Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.41,0:08:32.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden orada dikiliyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçki getir!!Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.37,0:08:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başkan, bir sorunumuz var!Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.62,0:08:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu, Makino?Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.79,0:08:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'nin başı dağ haydutlarıyla dertte!Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.50,0:08:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırak beni! Lanet olası!Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok tuhaf bir vücutmuş...Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür dile!Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.01,0:08:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne tür bir hayvan bu?Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni şerefsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!  Sana bunu ödeteceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.60,0:09:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ucubeyi iyi bir paraya satabiliriz.Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.90,0:09:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fazla inatçısın...Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Velet!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.11,0:09:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni gücendirecek bir şey mi söyledim?Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.28,0:09:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söyledin! Özür dile hemen!Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.66,0:09:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayağını suratımdan çek!Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuğu bırakın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.33,0:09:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalvarırım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.21,0:09:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizinle dövüşme niyetinde değilim.  İsterseniz para bile veririm!Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.09,0:09:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuğun hayatını bağışlayın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.30,0:09:31.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte, ihtiyarlar dünya nasıl işler biliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.80,0:09:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama hayır.Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.93,0:09:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun artık kimse kurtaramaz.Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.81,0:09:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çünkü beni sinirlendirdi.Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.52,0:09:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen...Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.64,0:09:45.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu lastik ucubeyle uğraşmaya  daha fazla katlanamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.56,0:09:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizler kötü adamlarsınız!  Sizi dağ maymunları!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu satmayacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öldürelim gitsin!Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.16,0:09:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen! Bırakın onu!Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimse bizi karşılamaya limana gelmedi...Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.67,0:10:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye merak ettim...Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçen günki dağ haydutları!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.51,0:10:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaptan-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.26,0:10:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, yumruklarının tabanca gibi  güçlü olduğunu sanıyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.81,0:10:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek siz korsanlar hala buradasınız?Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.89,0:10:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İncinmeden önce gitsen iyi olur.Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.40,0:10:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaklaşırsan beynini dağıtır, süt oğlanı.Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.94,0:10:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duymadın mı lan?Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafanı patlattırma bana!Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.41,0:10:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silahını çektiğine göre,  hayatını riske atıyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne saçmalıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.62,0:10:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diyorum ki  onlar insanları tehdit etmek için değildir.Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.47,0:11:00.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi kaşındın lan!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu şerefsizler kirli dövüşüyor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kirli mi?Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes lan traşı.Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.31,0:11:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Azizlerle falan mı  muhatap olduğunuzu sanıyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karşınızda korsanlar var!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.07,0:11:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes sesini!Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.32,0:11:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En başta bunun sizinle bir alakası yoktu!Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.53,0:11:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin, haydutlar.Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.53,0:11:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzerime alkol,  yemek dökülmesi veya tükürülmesi...Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.33,0:11:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...çoğu zaman gülüp geçeceğim şeylerdir!Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama şunu bilin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.33,0:11:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sebebi ne olursa olsun,...Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.08,0:11:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...arkadaşlarımın canını yakanlar bedelini ödemeliler!Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks...Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedelini ödemeliler, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aşağılık korsanlar!Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsini öldürün, beyler!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.64,0:11:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben hallederim.Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.90,0:11:48.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuk oyuncağı.Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.27,0:11:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi! Hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yandım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.41,0:12:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir tarafın kalkmasın, haydut.Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.37,0:12:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizimle dövüşmek istiyorsan git buraya savaş gemisi falan getir.Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.13,0:12:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok güçlü!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay canına...Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize ilk velet saldırdı!Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.17,0:12:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten aranan bir adamsın.Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.01,0:12:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sis bombası!Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.64,0:12:24.72,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Benimle gel velet!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırak beni!Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.23,0:12:29.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hass...! Gardımı indirdim! Luffy gitti! Ne yapacağız!?Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.69,0:12:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Telaşlanmayı bırak kaptan!Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları bulmamız uzun sürmez.Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.57,0:12:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu herife inanamıyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.16,0:12:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi sıvıştım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.20,0:12:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık sana ihtiyacım kalmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.95,0:12:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni şerefsi–Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bay bay!Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.67,0:12:56.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu pislik heriflere bir tane yumruk bile vuramadım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.71,0:12:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.64,0:13:04.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanların yüzlerini gördünüz mü?Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar, süt oğlanlarından başka bir şey değildir.Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.89,0:13:07.60,FlashbacksSecondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes lan!Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks ve diğerleriyle alay etmeyi kes!!!Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.81,0:13:10.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks ve diğerleriyle alay etmeyi kes!!!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal velet.Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.41,0:13:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Ne oluyor lan?Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.79,0:13:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edi...!Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni yiyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.18,0:13:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks...Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaybol!Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana borçlandım Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.23,0:14:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Makino-san bana her şeyi anlattı.Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim için dövüşmüşsün.Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ama, ağlama!Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Erkek adamsın!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.53,0:14:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama... Shanks...Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.33,0:14:50.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kolun!Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.16,0:14:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun değil. Sadece bir kol.Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.88,0:14:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaralanmamana sevindim.Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.85,0:15:12.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks'ın onu neden asla sefere götürmediğini anladı.Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.52,0:15:15.81,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizin sertliği, onun güçsüzlüğü.Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.81,0:15:19.31,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,En önemlisi, Shanks adındaki adamın büyüklüğü.Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.90,0:15:24.28,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün gerçekten onun gibi bir adam olacağına ant içti!Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.36,0:15:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks, geri gelmeyecek misin?Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.62,0:15:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen.Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.66,0:15:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayağı kaldık ama  artık yolları ayırma zamanı.Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.71,0:15:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.62,0:15:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık beni yanında götürmeni istemeyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.92,0:15:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi başıma korsan olmaya karar verdim!Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten seni almayacaktım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.13,0:15:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asla korsan olamayacaksın!Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.89,0:15:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün en az seninki kadar iyi bir tayfa toplayıp...Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.89,0:15:55.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...dünyadaki en büyük hazineyi bulacağım ve...Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Korsanlar Kralı olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.31,0:16:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.81,0:16:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi geçeceksiniz, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman...Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.49,0:16:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu şapkayı sana emanet ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.79,0:16:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim için çok değerlidir.Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün büyük bir korsan olduğunda...Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.59,0:16:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...onu bana geri getir.Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelecek vaat ediyor.Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.64,0:16:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen, tıpkı çocukluğumdaki ben gibi davranıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yelkenler fora!!!Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.02,0:16:47.78,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,10 yıl sonra,  bu çocuğun macerası aynı limanda başlayacaktı.Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.70,0:16:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda gidiyor, başkan.Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.37,0:16:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsan olması köyün adına leke sürecek.Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denize açılmak için ne güzel bir gün!Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olu...?Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.34,0:17:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte bizim Deniz Canavarı! Kime bulaştığını bilmiyorsun tabii.Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On yıldır üzerinde çalıştığım  bu tekniğe iyi bak!Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.07,0:17:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabanca!Dialogue: 50,0:17: